  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Floral Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fresh</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh Solar</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes:</strong> Rice Milk, Tiare Water, Ambrox, Evening Jasmine</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Description:</strong> A fresh solar take on the classic Glossier You skin-scent enhancer, Soie Eau de Parfum smells different on everyone. Fresh bergamot opens the fragrance, followed by a creamy, solar floral heart of rice milk, Tiare water, and evening jasmine, all heightened by a warm, musky Ambrox base. Mostly, it smells intimate, floral, sensual, velvety, and sheer.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Spray scent as desired on your pulse points: your neck, behind your ears, your wrists, and more.<br>-Allow fragrance to settle for a few moments rather than rubbing it in as this can disrupt the scent. <br>-Apply post-shower, after moisturizing to aid absorption for a longer, stronger scent impact.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Fragrance/Parfum, Water/Aqua/Eau, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Hexamethylindanopyran, Pelargonium Graveolens Flower Oil, Santalum Album Oil, Vanillin, Benzyl Salicylate, Trimethylcyclopentenyl Methylisopentenol, Santalol, Coumarin, Citronellol, Farnesol, Linalool, Benzaldehyde, Pinene, Limonene, Beta-Caryophyllene.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Floral Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fresh</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh Solar</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes:</strong> Rice Milk, Tiare Water, Ambrox, Evening Jasmine</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Description:</strong> A fresh solar take on the classic Glossier You skin-scent enhancer, Soie Eau de Parfum smells different on everyone. Fresh bergamot opens the fragrance, followed by a creamy, solar floral heart of rice milk, Tiare water, and evening jasmine, all heightened by a warm, musky Ambrox base. Mostly, it smells intimate, floral, sensual, velvety, and sheer.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Spray scent as desired on your pulse points: your neck, behind your ears, your wrists, and more.<br>-Allow fragrance to settle for a few moments rather than rubbing it in as this can disrupt the scent. <br>-Apply post-shower, after moisturizing to aid absorption for a longer, stronger scent impact.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Fragrance/Parfum, Water/Aqua/Eau, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Hexamethylindanopyran, Pelargonium Graveolens Flower Oil, Santalum Album Oil, Vanillin, Benzyl Salicylate, Trimethylcyclopentenyl Methylisopentenol, Santalol, Coumarin, Citronellol, Farnesol, Linalool, Benzaldehyde, Pinene, Limonene, Beta-Caryophyllene.</div></details>",
